{"title": "网段放行实测（127.0.0.0/8）", "lines": [
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx/1.31.5 容器，容器网卡 IP 172.17.0.3"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "allow 127.0.0.0/8;"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "deny all;"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}' 127.0.0.1/"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "200"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}' 172.17.0.3/"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "403"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "同一台机器两个来源：环回命中网段放行，网卡 IP 网段外被拒"}
]}
